---
title:    "An Integrated Development Environment for Declarative Multi-Paradigm Programming"
citation: "(WLPE 2001)"
url:      "https://www.michaelhanus.de/papers/WLPE01.html"
date:     2001-01-01 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
---
This paper describes CIDER,
a graphical programming and development environment for Curry
and other declarative programming languages.
CIDER is intended as a platform to integrate various tools for analyzing
and debugging Curry programs.